中之後會爆炸，並生出一個持續往前推進的龍捲風。",{"attributes":213,"type":215,"consume":203,"power":216},[214],"9",[202],"67",{"id":218,"type":157,"props":219},"91268518_40",{"id":220,"customKey":47,"icon":221,"iconStyle":65,"iconTitle":47,"descTitle":222,"descContent":223,"source":224},"91268518_41","/cdn/init/1018100_Skill_10900090_Icon.png","進行曲","吹奏樂曲，獲得樂章系列增益：「進行曲」，每秒回復0.8%最大生命值，持續20秒。當獲得3個樂章系列增益時，所有樂章效果提升30%。",{"attributes":225,"type":226,"consume":203,"power":227},[214],[227],"0",{"id":229,"type":157,"props":230},"91268518_42",{"id":231,"customKey":47,"icon":232,"iconStyle":65,"iconTitle":47,"descTitle":233,"descContent":234,"source":235},"91268518_43","/cdn/init/1018100_Skill_10300220_Icon.png","流水龍捲","在目標處施放「流水氣旋」，造成傷害並吸附至中心。",{"attributes":236,"type":238,"consume":203,"power":204},[237],"3",[202],{"id":240,"type":157,"props":241},"91268518_44",{"id":242,"customKey":47,"icon":243,"iconStyle":65,"iconTitle":47,"descTitle":244,"descContent":245,"source":246},"91268518_45","/cdn/init/1018100_Skill_10900041_Icon.png","龍捲風","在目標位置施放氣旋，造成傷害並往中心吸入。",{"attributes":247,"type":248,"consume":203,"power":204},[214],[202],{"id":250,"title":251,"children":252},"91268518_46","固有技能",[253],{"id":254,"type":157,"props":255},"91268518_47",{"id":256,"customKey":47,"icon":257,"iconStyle":65,"iconTitle":47,"descTitle":258,"descContent":259,"source":260},"91268518_48","/cdn/init/1018100_Skill_14400000_Icon.png","攻擊","使用風元素能力，遠距離攻擊目標。",{"attributes":261,"type":262,"consume":227,"power":200},[214],[202],[264,265,266],{"id":4,"entryId":12,"currentMorphology":21,"visible":15},{"id":6,"entryId":12,"currentMorphology":13,"visible":15},{"id":267,"entryId":12,"currentMorphology":268,"visible":15},"10003469","Highland Form",[270,282,292,302,314,324,333,337,346,355,364,375,385,397,407,418,429,439,449,459,469,479,489,500,510,520,530,540,550,560,570,580,590,600,610,620,630,641,651,661,671,681,691,701,711,721,731,741,751,761,771,781,791,801,811,821,831,841,851,861,871,881,891,901,911,921,931,941,951,961,971,981,991,1001,1011,1021,1031,1041,1051,1061,1071,1081,1091,1101,1111,1121,1131,1141,1151,1161,1171,1181,1191,1202],{"id":271,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":272,"visible":15},"10003442",{"type":10,"entryId":273,"sortOrder":274,"name":275,"imageUrl":276,"description":277,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":278,"attributes":280},"001",1005100,"小炭狗","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10051.png","活潑好動且總愛跟在焚火狼後頭。蓬鬆炭毛中夾雜著隱燃星火，當火光匯聚燃燒之時，便是牠成長之日。",[279],"position-dps",[281],"attributes-fire",{"id":283,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":284,"visible":15},"10003534",{"type":10,"entryId":285,"sortOrder":286,"name":287,"imageUrl":288,"description":289,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":202,"position":290,"attributes":291},"002",1005200,"焚火狼","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10052.png","習慣成群結隊活動，極度重視忠誠與團結，冷靜專注的眼神下隱藏著如烈焰般熾熱的心。",[279],[281],{"id":293,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":294,"visible":15},"10003435",{"type":10,"entryId":295,"sortOrder":296,"name":297,"imageUrl":298,"description":299,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":300,"attributes":301},"003",1005300,"狼鬥士","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10053.png","性格好勝，面對越強大的對手越是熱血沸騰。烈火與焦炭將化為印記，見證牠不斷變強的歷程。",[279],[281],{"id":303,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":304,"visible":15},"10003428",{"type":10,"entryId":305,"sortOrder":306,"name":307,"imageUrl":308,"description":309,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":310,"attributes":312},"004",1005500,"獄魂狼","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10055.png","挑戰強者落敗的焚火狼，吸收了同樣懷恨倒下的同伴靈魂，以復仇的欲望驅使自身行動。",[311],"position-break",[281,313],"attributes-dark",{"id":315,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":316,"visible":15},"10003578",{"type":10,"entryId":317,"sortOrder":318,"name":319,"imageUrl":320,"description":321,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":322,"attributes":323},"005",1001100,"星樂蒂","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10011.png","在林間飛行尋找食物時，頭上的發光星星常被誤認作流星。超級貪吃，有囤積食物的習慣，也會用食物來裝飾自己的小窩。",[279],[313],{"id":325,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":326,"visible":15},"10003417",{"type":10,"entryId":8,"sortOrder":327,"name":328,"imageUrl":329,"description":330,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":331,"attributes":332},1001200,"星法師","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10012.png","獨來獨往，常穿梭在夜色之中。外型如同身披星空斗篷的神祕魔法師，能夠使用精神能量進行瞬移。",[279],[313],{"id":4,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":334,"visible":15},{"type":10,"entryId":12,"sortOrder":17,"name":18,"imageUrl":19,"description":20,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":335,"attributes":336},[24],[26],{"id":338,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":339,"visible":15},"10003548",{"type":10,"entryId":340,"sortOrder":341,"name":81,"imageUrl":342,"description":343,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":344,"attributes":345},"008",1018400,"/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10184.png","生性熱鬧且能奏出充滿節奏感的樂聲，常按捺不住內心衝動，加入同伴間的即興合奏。",[24],[26],{"id":347,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":348,"visible":15},"10003474",{"type":10,"entryId":349,"sortOrder":350,"name":89,"imageUrl":351,"description":352,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":353,"attributes":354},"009",1018500,"/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10185.png","能發出響徹海灘的嘹亮尖叫，愛出風頭的牠並不在意製造噪音。為了耳朵健康，最好別惹怒牠。",[279],[26],{"id":356,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":357,"visible":15},"10003467",{"type":10,"entryId":358,"sortOrder":359,"name":96,"imageUrl":360,"description":361,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":362,"attributes":363},"010",1018700,"/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10187.png","能發出低沉的大號音色。性格如音色般厚重沉穩且待人友善，風暴降臨海岸時，待在牠身邊總能感到安心。",[311],[26],{"id":365,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":366,"visible":15},"10003392",{"type":10,"entryId":367,"sortOrder":368,"name":369,"imageUrl":370,"description":371,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":372,"attributes":373},"011",1021100,"飄飄花","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10211.png","飄飄花的身軀極其輕盈，常乘風飄起並藉由花瓣裙的阻力緩緩旋轉降落，或是乾脆隨風四處旅行。",[279],[374],"attributes-grass",{"id":376,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":377,"visible":15},"10003510",{"type":10,"entryId":378,"sortOrder":379,"name":380,"imageUrl":381,"description":382,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":383,"attributes":384},"012",1021200,"花舞蘭","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10212.png","沉浸於表演之中，最大目標是精進舞藝，期盼有朝一日讓所有生物都能感受舞蹈中的生命力。",[279],[374],{"id":386,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":387,"visible":15},"10003477",{"type":10,"entryId":388,"sortOrder":389,"name":390,"imageUrl":391,"description":392,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":393,"attributes":395},"014",1004100,"蓮頂魚","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10041.png","喜歡躲在水下探頭觀察新鮮事物。牠以為蓮葉帽是絕佳偽裝，卻不知在水面移動的蓮葉更引人注目。",[394],"position-heal",[396],"attributes-water",{"id":398,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":399,"visible":15},"10003569",{"type":10,"entryId":400,"sortOrder":401,"name":402,"imageUrl":403,"description":404,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":202,"position":405,"attributes":406},"015",1004200,"搗蛋魚","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10042.png","極度懼怕高溫，喜歡待在涼爽濕潤處。體表覆蓋著保濕降溫膜，觸感滑溜。若離開水太久，皮膚會乾裂。",[394],[396],{"id":408,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":409,"visible":15},"10003470",{"type":10,"entryId":410,"sortOrder":411,"name":412,"imageUrl":413,"description":414,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":415,"attributes":416},"016",1004300,"熒冰龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10043.png","外型與氣質皆極致優雅。天性善良且樂於照顧弱小，但若想利用這份善意傷害牠，將會被瞬間凍成冰塊。",[394],[396,417],"attributes-ice",{"id":419,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":420,"visible":15},"10003463",{"type":10,"entryId":421,"sortOrder":422,"name":423,"imageUrl":424,"description":425,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":426,"attributes":428},"017",1004500,"蓮冠龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10045.png","與蓮花為伴並棲身於蓮葉間，習慣以擬態蓮葉的尾部遮掩面容，展現出矜持且高雅的姿態。",[427],"position-energy",[374,396],{"id":430,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":431,"visible":15},"10003468",{"type":10,"entryId":432,"sortOrder":433,"name":434,"imageUrl":435,"description":436,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":437,"attributes":438},"018",1026100,"雲朵羊","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10261.png","喜歡在晴朗草原上成群活動，輕飄飄的身軀能懸停於雲霧中，三三兩兩擠作一團。",[24],[26],{"id":440,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":441,"visible":15},"10003365",{"type":10,"entryId":442,"sortOrder":443,"name":444,"imageUrl":445,"description":446,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":447,"attributes":448},"019",1026200,"蓬蓬羊","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10262.png","喜歡躲在雲團中睡覺，因風壓與靜電存在，蓬鬆羊毛極易吸附隨風飛過的小物。",[24],[26],{"id":450,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":451,"visible":15},"10003461",{"type":10,"entryId":452,"sortOrder":453,"name":454,"imageUrl":455,"description":456,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":457,"attributes":458},"020",1026300,"眠眠羊","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10263.png","吸收夢境能量的毛髮呈現出迷離幻彩。當牠將這團毛髮當作枕頭呼呼大睡時，便能沉入甜美夢鄉。",[24],[313],{"id":460,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":461,"visible":15},"10003421",{"type":10,"entryId":462,"sortOrder":463,"name":464,"imageUrl":465,"description":466,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":467,"attributes":468},"021",1020100,"跑調草","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10201.png","成群結隊生活在草原上，平時鑽入地底吸收養分。喜歡聚在一起唱歌，卻對自己的走音毫無自覺。",[311],[374],{"id":470,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":471,"visible":15},"10003414",{"type":10,"entryId":472,"sortOrder":473,"name":474,"imageUrl":475,"description":476,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":477,"attributes":478},"022",1020300,"女巫草","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10203.png","討厭闖入領地的生物，會發出古怪音波擾亂對手心智、降低防禦力，甚至能讓對方陷入昏迷。",[427],[313,374],{"id":480,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":481,"visible":15},"10003404",{"type":10,"entryId":482,"sortOrder":483,"name":484,"imageUrl":485,"description":486,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":487,"attributes":488},"023",1020700,"埋埋草","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10207.png","曾長時間埋入地底，重見天日時已變得巨大無比。需靠根系吸收土壤養分維持活力，極度厭惡離開土地。",[311],[374],{"id":490,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":491,"visible":15},"10003567",{"type":10,"entryId":492,"sortOrder":493,"name":494,"imageUrl":495,"description":496,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":497,"attributes":498},"024",1016100,"花芽蟹","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10161.png","一生只會選擇一名伴侶，對愛情極其專一且總是成雙成對活動。頭頂的蟹心草代表著牠的幸福程度。",[311],[499,374],"attributes-rock",{"id":501,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":502,"visible":15},"10003462",{"type":10,"entryId":503,"sortOrder":504,"name":505,"imageUrl":506,"description":507,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":508,"attributes":509},"025",1016200,"蔥蔥蟹","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10162.png","茂盛植株完全覆蓋背殼並透過吸收日光提供養分，在陽光充足時，不必額外進食就能生存。",[311],[499,374],{"id":511,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":512,"visible":15},"10003551",{"type":10,"entryId":513,"sortOrder":514,"name":515,"imageUrl":516,"description":517,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":518,"attributes":519},"026",1016300,"晶殼蟹","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10163.png","幽居於洞穴中且因食物含豐富礦物質，背殼逐漸被晶體覆蓋。平時藏身地下，以華麗背殼吸引獵物靠近。",[311],[417],{"id":521,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":522,"visible":15},"10003409",{"type":10,"entryId":523,"sortOrder":524,"name":525,"imageUrl":526,"description":527,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":528,"attributes":529},"027",1033100,"幽幽焰","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10331.png","外表雖如火焰，但那僅是能量流動的型態，不僅不發熱還會吸收周圍熱量。有時會以此偽裝成篝火戲弄他人。",[427],[281],{"id":531,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":532,"visible":15},"10003507",{"type":10,"entryId":533,"sortOrder":534,"name":535,"imageUrl":536,"description":537,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":538,"attributes":539},"028",1033300,"幻焰靈","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10333.png","僅在深夜現身，身軀由氣態能量構成，因此能隨意分裂，甚至具備製造分身的能力。",[427],[281],{"id":541,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":542,"visible":15},"10003542",{"type":10,"entryId":543,"sortOrder":544,"name":545,"imageUrl":546,"description":547,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":548,"attributes":549},"029",1023100,"螢粉蝶","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10231.png","膽小且警惕，察覺危險便會尋找藏身處，但抖落的螢光鱗粉卻總是暴露行蹤。",[394],[26],{"id":551,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":552,"visible":15},"10003440",{"type":10,"entryId":553,"sortOrder":554,"name":555,"imageUrl":556,"description":557,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":558,"attributes":559},"030",1023200,"幻翼蝶","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10232.png","個性冷淡且獨來獨往，察覺危險迫近時會搧動翅膀吹出鱗粉製造幻覺迷惑對手，隨後慢悠悠地離開。",[394],[26],{"id":561,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":562,"visible":15},"10003563",{"type":10,"entryId":563,"sortOrder":564,"name":565,"imageUrl":566,"description":567,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":227,"position":568,"attributes":569},"031",1023300,"幻夢蝶","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10233.png","蝶翼閃爍著絢麗光輝，揮動翅膀時灑落的鱗粉能促進花卉生長，使所到之處皆生機盎然。",[427],[26,374],{"id":571,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":572,"visible":15},"10003368",{"type":10,"entryId":573,"sortOrder":574,"name":575,"imageUrl":576,"description":577,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":578,"attributes":579},"032",1044100,"大耳蝠","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10441.png","大耳朵高高聳立且對聲音極其敏感，只要是牠追蹤的動靜，無論遠近都不會遺漏。",[24],[26],{"id":581,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":582,"visible":15},"10003363",{"type":10,"entryId":583,"sortOrder":584,"name":585,"imageUrl":586,"description":587,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":588,"attributes":589},"033",1044300,"偵探蝠","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10443.png","好奇心旺盛，熱衷於搜尋痕跡與追蹤目標，尾部圓環能放大超音波，輕鬆識破隱身把戲。",[24],[26],{"id":591,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":592,"visible":15},"10003515",{"type":10,"entryId":593,"sortOrder":594,"name":595,"imageUrl":596,"description":597,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":598,"attributes":599},"034",1032100,"小哭苞","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10321.png","膽小且怕痛，稍有動靜就掉眼淚，但被逼急時也會揮舞棘刺反抗。當真正勇敢時，頭頂花苞便會綻放。",[279],[374],{"id":601,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":602,"visible":15},"10003496",{"type":10,"entryId":603,"sortOrder":604,"name":605,"imageUrl":606,"description":607,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":608,"attributes":609},"035",1032300,"刺劍玫","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10323.png","刺莖化成的長劍平時收納於手臂葉片中，唯有戰鬥時才會抽出。性格無畏且不懼挑戰，盡心盡力守護著族群。",[279],[374],{"id":611,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":612,"visible":15},"10003378",{"type":10,"entryId":613,"sortOrder":614,"name":615,"imageUrl":616,"description":617,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":618,"attributes":619},"036",1032400,"魅樂薇","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10324.png","為平息紛爭，它會散落馨香花瓣，令接觸者心生幸福感，進而使戰意消散。",[24],[374],{"id":621,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":622,"visible":15},"10003456",{"type":10,"entryId":623,"sortOrder":624,"name":625,"imageUrl":626,"description":627,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":628,"attributes":629},"037",1047100,"河童蛋","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10471.png","休息時縮入殼中，有時會被誤認為伊莫蛋。害怕戰鬥卻愛湊熱鬧，喜歡揮舞草球跳舞助威。",[311],[374],{"id":631,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":632,"visible":15},"10003374",{"type":10,"entryId":633,"sortOrder":634,"name":635,"imageUrl":636,"description":637,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":638,"attributes":639},"038",1047400,"霹靂蜥","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10474.png","四肢靈活的牠見誰都想炫耀華麗踢技，喜歡將蛻下的皮像兜帽一樣帥氣地套在頭上。",[24],[640],"attributes-electric",{"id":642,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":643,"visible":15},"10003443",{"type":10,"entryId":644,"sortOrder":645,"name":646,"imageUrl":647,"description":648,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":649,"attributes":650},"039",1047500,"咆尾蜥","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10475.png","高聳鬣毛盡顯狂放，野性咆哮張揚本色。尾部構造能收納聲波，撞擊對手時會施放音爆攻擊。",[311],[374],{"id":652,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":653,"visible":15},"10003503",{"type":10,"entryId":654,"sortOrder":655,"name":656,"imageUrl":657,"description":658,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":659,"attributes":660},"040",1035100,"採蜜鳥","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10351.png","將採集的花蜜儲存於體內發酵，吐出後可作為香水原料，是調香師們不可或缺的合作夥伴。",[24],[313],{"id":662,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":663,"visible":15},"10003521",{"type":10,"entryId":664,"sortOrder":665,"name":666,"imageUrl":667,"description":668,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":669,"attributes":670},"041",1035200,"香氛鳥","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10352.png","對氣味極其挑剔，會取食不同花蜜儲存於體內，調配專屬香水原料，全身羽毛皆浸透著獨特香氣。",[24],[313],{"id":672,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":673,"visible":15},"10003508",{"type":10,"entryId":674,"sortOrder":675,"name":676,"imageUrl":677,"description":678,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":679,"attributes":680},"042",1003100,"幽爪鐮","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10031.png","戰勝同伴是進化的唯一途徑。為了應對隨時出現的對手，牠隨時都在尋找合適的石頭磨利爪子。",[279],[313],{"id":682,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":683,"visible":15},"10003369",{"type":10,"entryId":684,"sortOrder":685,"name":686,"imageUrl":687,"description":688,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":689,"attributes":690},"043",1003200,"淬刃螂","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10032.png","磨礪利刃並靜待時機，在暗影中以匿蹤之姿戲弄對手，是名追求一擊必殺的冷酷刺客。",[279],[313],{"id":692,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":693,"visible":15},"10003501",{"type":10,"entryId":694,"sortOrder":695,"name":696,"imageUrl":697,"description":698,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":699,"attributes":700},"044",1003300,"電刺螂","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10033.png","前肢折斷的幽爪鐮吸收雷電之力進化而來，重塑後的逆刃鋒利無比，閃爍著耀眼的電光。",[279],[640],{"id":702,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":703,"visible":15},"10003422",{"type":10,"entryId":704,"sortOrder":705,"name":706,"imageUrl":707,"description":708,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":709,"attributes":710},"045",1013100,"冰骨狼","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10131.png","長著一對大耳朵的元氣狼仔，胸前的冰骨領結是牠最愛的玩具。最討厭行事沒有邊界的小炭狗。",[279],[417],{"id":712,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":713,"visible":15},"10003575",{"type":10,"entryId":714,"sortOrder":715,"name":716,"imageUrl":717,"description":718,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":202,"position":719,"attributes":720},"046",1013200,"冰刃狼","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10132.png","唯恐喪失鬥志而極度反感被撫摸，跟隨族群捕獵時總是咬著冰刀衝在最前線，渴望成為獨當一面的戰士。",[279],[417],{"id":722,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":723,"visible":15},"10003415",{"type":10,"entryId":724,"sortOrder":725,"name":726,"imageUrl":727,"description":728,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":729,"attributes":730},"047",1013300,"霜鋒狼","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10133.png","對實力充滿絕對自信的高傲戰士，口中冰刃散發著凜冽寒氣，唯有面對強敵時才會感到興奮。",[279],[417],{"id":732,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":733,"visible":15},"10003524",{"type":10,"entryId":734,"sortOrder":735,"name":736,"imageUrl":737,"description":738,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":739,"attributes":740},"048",1022100,"閃電貂","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10221.png","生活在樹林間，攻擊時尾巴會冒出金色電光與劈啪作響的電流聲。動作靈巧敏捷，極難捕捉。",[311],[640],{"id":742,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":743,"visible":15},"10003475",{"type":10,"entryId":744,"sortOrder":745,"name":746,"imageUrl":747,"description":748,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":749,"attributes":750},"049",1022200,"雷光貂","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10222.png","透過特殊毛髮產生的靜電吸引空氣中的帶電粒子來蓄電。被水淋濕會影響蓄電能力，因此雨天很少出現。",[311],[640],{"id":752,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":753,"visible":15},"10003523",{"type":10,"entryId":754,"sortOrder":755,"name":756,"imageUrl":757,"description":758,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":759,"attributes":760},"050",1017100,"羞羞獺","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10171.png","會四處挖掘尋找求愛禮物，卻因太容易害羞而常告白失敗。用小爪子搓揉臉頰是牠的標誌性動作。",[311],[396],{"id":762,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":763,"visible":15},"10003398",{"type":10,"entryId":764,"sortOrder":765,"name":766,"imageUrl":767,"description":768,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":202,"position":769,"attributes":770},"051",1017200,"泡泡獺","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10172.png","會精心挑選貝殼並製作與身形相配的新鏟子。據說遇到心動對象時，身邊會浮現粉紅色的泡泡。",[311],[396],{"id":772,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":773,"visible":15},"10003516",{"type":10,"entryId":774,"sortOrder":775,"name":776,"imageUrl":777,"description":778,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":779,"attributes":780},"052",1017300,"漂漂獺","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10173.png","生性自戀且每天花大量時間梳理毛髮。精心計算出水姿態並享受被追隨的感覺，發達肌肉卻因毛髮濃密而無法炫耀。",[24],[396],{"id":782,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":783,"visible":15},"10003566",{"type":10,"entryId":784,"sortOrder":785,"name":786,"imageUrl":787,"description":788,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":789,"attributes":790},"053",1017400,"胖胖獺","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10174.png","強壯身軀能爆發出驚人力量，但比起炫耀武力更喜歡宅在巢穴，並蒐集各式裝飾物來裝點家園。",[311],[396],{"id":792,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":793,"visible":15},"10003453",{"type":10,"entryId":794,"sortOrder":795,"name":796,"imageUrl":797,"description":798,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":799,"attributes":800},"054",1019100,"貝殼星","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10191.png","用柔軟腕足吸附貝殼包裹自身，混跡在沙灘的普通貝殼堆中，平時緊閉甲殼，僅在夜晚打開沐浴月光。",[279],[396],{"id":802,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":803,"visible":15},"10003577",{"type":10,"entryId":804,"sortOrder":805,"name":806,"imageUrl":807,"description":808,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":202,"position":809,"attributes":810},"055",1019200,"智多星","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10192.png","嚮往著璀璨星空，常躺在背殼上搖晃身體，閉上雙眼沉浸於星辰編織的夢境之中。",[279],[396],{"id":812,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":813,"visible":15},"10003570",{"type":10,"entryId":814,"sortOrder":815,"name":816,"imageUrl":817,"description":818,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":819,"attributes":820},"056",1019400,"星騎士","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10194.png","將曾包裹自身的貝殼化作劍與盾，當脆弱的貝殼星遇險時會挺身而出。喜歡沿海岸線逐浪而行。",[279],[396],{"id":822,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":823,"visible":15},"10003565",{"type":10,"entryId":824,"sortOrder":825,"name":826,"imageUrl":827,"description":828,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":829,"attributes":830},"057",1045100,"滾滾郎","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10451.png","從出生起就與石球形影不離，透過不斷滾動讓球體越來越圓，但牠推著的石球似乎不像表面上那麼簡單。",[279],[499],{"id":832,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":833,"visible":15},"10003476",{"type":10,"entryId":834,"sortOrder":835,"name":836,"imageUrl":837,"description":838,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":839,"attributes":840},"058",1045300,"機車郎","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10453.png","像以前一樣倒著前進，因完全掌控了滾球技巧，能做出各種高難度動作攻擊目標。",[279],[499],{"id":842,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":843,"visible":15},"10003466",{"type":10,"entryId":844,"sortOrder":845,"name":846,"imageUrl":847,"description":848,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":849,"attributes":850},"059",1045400,"岩球郎","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10454.png","與滾滾郎朝夕相伴的石球因顛簸而覺醒，厭倦了身不由己的它吞噬蟲體後，終於能憑藉自身意志進行活動。",[24],[499],{"id":852,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":853,"visible":15},"10003379",{"type":10,"entryId":854,"sortOrder":855,"name":856,"imageUrl":857,"description":858,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":859,"attributes":860},"060",1029100,"天使茸","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10291.png","總是掛著招牌笑容，熱情邀請其他伊莫一同玩耍。雖偶爾因頑皮或嘴饞惹出麻煩，但總能獲得原諒。",[279],[640],{"id":862,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":863,"visible":15},"10003376",{"type":10,"entryId":864,"sortOrder":865,"name":866,"imageUrl":867,"description":868,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":869,"attributes":870},"061",1029300,"疾電茸","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10293.png","憑藉毛髮優異的導電性能，凝集雷光之力延伸出雙翼，以疾馳之姿驅散陰霾，讓心情也隨之轉晴。",[279],[640],{"id":872,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":873,"visible":15},"10003543",{"type":10,"entryId":874,"sortOrder":875,"name":876,"imageUrl":877,"description":878,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":879,"attributes":880},"062",1002100,"大眼盔","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10021.png","堅硬的頭盔保護柔軟的身體，能從口中伸出勾爪掠食，富有彈性的身體能裝下自身十倍體積的食物。",[311],[313],{"id":882,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":883,"visible":15},"10003557",{"type":10,"entryId":884,"sortOrder":885,"name":886,"imageUrl":887,"description":888,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":889,"attributes":890},"063",1002600,"盔勇士","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10026.png","獲得斷劍與盔甲並傳承了勇氣與力量，終於成為一名能守護同伴、直面強敵的勇士。",[279],[313],{"id":892,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":893,"visible":15},"10003522",{"type":10,"entryId":894,"sortOrder":895,"name":896,"imageUrl":897,"description":898,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":899,"attributes":900},"064",1002700,"盔衛士","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10027.png","身材高大卻性格膽小，遇到危險就縮成球逃避戰鬥，但為了守護同伴，牠也能鼓起勇氣應戰。",[311],[313],{"id":902,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":903,"visible":15},"10003579",{"type":10,"entryId":904,"sortOrder":905,"name":906,"imageUrl":907,"description":908,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":909,"attributes":910},"065",1002400,"鋼顎仔","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10024.png","路過什麼都想啃一口。下巴活動性極佳，張開角度驚人。牠習慣以輕咬表達喜悅，尤其偏愛金屬製品，因為不容易咬壞。",[311],[26],{"id":912,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":913,"visible":15},"10003389",{"type":10,"entryId":914,"sortOrder":915,"name":916,"imageUrl":917,"description":918,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":202,"position":919,"attributes":920},"066",1002200,"盔面龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10022.png","幼龍將脆弱隱藏於頭盔之下，內心渴望變得更強並自由翱翔，前往世界各個角落尋找隱匿的寶藏。",[311],[26],{"id":922,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":923,"visible":15},"10003536",{"type":10,"entryId":924,"sortOrder":925,"name":926,"imageUrl":927,"description":928,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":929,"attributes":930},"067",1002300,"銀盔龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10023.png","全身覆蓋著堅硬鎧甲，停駐於石台時宛如高大的雕像。傳說牠會守在遺跡入口，看守古老的寶藏。",[311],[26],{"id":932,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":933,"visible":15},"10003529",{"type":10,"entryId":934,"sortOrder":935,"name":936,"imageUrl":937,"description":938,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":939,"attributes":940},"068",1002500,"炎鎧龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10025.png","身披烈焰淬煉後的金屬重鎧，暴怒噴發的火焰能瞬間將周遭化為熔岩。不想化為灰燼就離牠遠點。",[279],[281],{"id":942,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":943,"visible":15},"10003433",{"type":10,"entryId":944,"sortOrder":945,"name":946,"imageUrl":947,"description":948,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":949,"attributes":950},"069",1050100,"迷夢仔","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10501.png","白天處於夢遊狀態，若被吵醒會瞬間暴躁失控，一旦體力耗盡便會乖乖墜入夢鄉。",[279],[499],{"id":952,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":953,"visible":15},"10003427",{"type":10,"entryId":954,"sortOrder":955,"name":956,"imageUrl":957,"description":958,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":959,"attributes":960},"070",1050300,"暴睡熊","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10503.png","在平日的溫柔之下，是時刻的隱忍與克制，但若受刺激或腹中空空時，便會無法自控並陷入狂暴之中。",[279],[499],{"id":962,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":963,"visible":15},"10003405",{"type":10,"entryId":964,"sortOrder":965,"name":966,"imageUrl":967,"description":968,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":969,"attributes":970},"071",1028100,"碎岩仔","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10281.png","天生具備感應礦石的能力，偏好進食各種礦石，且攝取的礦石種類會直接影響其成長方向。",[311],[499],{"id":972,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":973,"visible":15},"10003525",{"type":10,"entryId":974,"sortOrder":975,"name":976,"imageUrl":977,"description":978,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":202,"position":979,"attributes":980},"072",1028200,"熾岩龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10282.png","以堅硬利爪擊碎晶石後吞服以儲存熱量，體表也因此顯現火紅紋路。體型雖小巧，卻能從口中持續噴出高熱焰流。",[311],[281,499],{"id":982,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":983,"visible":15},"10003399",{"type":10,"entryId":984,"sortOrder":985,"name":986,"imageUrl":987,"description":988,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":989,"attributes":990},"073",1028300,"熔暴龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10283.png","熾熱晶體如凝結的熔岩般於身軀生長，其積存的熱量若瞬間爆發，足以熔毀擋在面前的一切阻礙。",[311],[281,499],{"id":992,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":993,"visible":15},"10003518",{"type":10,"entryId":994,"sortOrder":995,"name":996,"imageUrl":997,"description":998,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":202,"position":999,"attributes":1000},"074",1028400,"晶背龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10284.png","攝取的晶礦在體內經過提煉，會化為蘊含精純能量的晶脊向外生長。",[311],[499],{"id":1002,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":1003,"visible":15},"10003393",{"type":10,"entryId":1004,"sortOrder":1005,"name":1006,"imageUrl":1007,"description":1008,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":1009,"attributes":1010},"075",1028500,"晶簇龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10285.png","棲息於晶礦充足之地，背部晶脊極其堅硬，不僅能保護身體，更是儲存能量的重要結構。",[311],[499],{"id":1012,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":1013,"visible":15},"10003386",{"type":10,"entryId":1014,"sortOrder":1015,"name":1016,"imageUrl":1017,"description":1018,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":1019,"attributes":1020},"076",1043100,"蟻煙囪","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10431.png","蟻煙囪用泥土一點一滴修築自己的外殼，遇險時會從頂部孔洞噴出煙霧籠罩四周，藉此遮掩身形。",[24],[499],{"id":1022,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":1023,"visible":15},"10003447",{"type":10,"entryId":1024,"sortOrder":1025,"name":1026,"imageUrl":1027,"description":1028,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":1029,"attributes":1030},"077",1043300,"蟻地堡","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10433.png","上下身體具備可獨立旋轉的結構，讓蟻地堡能靈活觀察四周，並伺機變形出砲台擊退對手。",[24],[499],{"id":1032,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":1033,"visible":15},"10003497",{"type":10,"entryId":1034,"sortOrder":1035,"name":1036,"imageUrl":1037,"description":1038,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":1039,"attributes":1040},"078",1014100,"燈泡水母","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10141.png","生性膽小，一有風吹草動便立刻逃走，頭頂燈泡狀器官會隨著健康狀況產生變化。",[24],[640],{"id":1042,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":1043,"visible":15},"10003479",{"type":10,"entryId":1044,"sortOrder":1045,"name":1046,"imageUrl":1047,"description":1048,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":202,"position":1049,"attributes":1050},"079",1014200,"燈紗水母","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10142.png","極度怕黑的水母，每當夜晚降臨便會開始發光，即便入睡也不熄滅，猶如一盞守夜明燈。",[24],[640],{"id":1052,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":1053,"visible":15},"10003388",{"type":10,"entryId":1054,"sortOrder":1055,"name":1056,"imageUrl":1057,"description":1058,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":1059,"attributes":1060},"080",1014300,"吊燈水母","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10143.png","能根據心情自如調節發光的亮度與頻率。觸手不僅能閃爍出炫麗獨特的光斑，還能傳導電流攻擊目標。",[24],[640],{"id":1062,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":1063,"visible":15},"10003429",{"type":10,"entryId":1064,"sortOrder":1065,"name":1066,"imageUrl":1067,"description":1068,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":1069,"attributes":1070},"081",1048100,"浴球鳥","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10481.png","揉搓體表油脂會產生大量泡沫，既能清潔又能保護自己，但有時也會踩到泡沫而滑倒。",[427],[396],{"id":1072,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":1073,"visible":15},"10003430",{"type":10,"entryId":1074,"sortOrder":1075,"name":1076,"imageUrl":1077,"description":1078,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":1079,"attributes":1080},"082",1048300,"沐羽鳥","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10483.png","羽毛會不斷分泌油脂，稍加揉搓就能產生各式各樣的泡泡，而用於保護背上幼鳥的，自然是其中最柔軟綿密的一種。",[427],[396],{"id":1082,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":1083,"visible":15},"10003549",{"type":10,"entryId":1084,"sortOrder":1085,"name":1086,"imageUrl":1087,"description":1088,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":227,"position":1089,"attributes":1090},"083",1012200,"貝瑟斯","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10122.png","深受心跳鼓點困擾的貝瑟斯，不斷尋找能掩蓋鼓聲的節奏，熱愛搖擺身體並追求前衛的音樂藝術。",[427],[640],{"id":1092,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":1093,"visible":15},"10003494",{"type":10,"entryId":1094,"sortOrder":1095,"name":1096,"imageUrl":1097,"description":1098,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":1099,"attributes":1100},"084",1038100,"珊殼魚","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10381.png","將身體埋入地底偽裝成珊瑚，一旦獵物靠近便會一口咬上。不過偶爾也會耐不住性子，露出眼睛四處張望。",[427],[499,396],{"id":1102,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":1103,"visible":15},"10003486",{"type":10,"entryId":1104,"sortOrder":1105,"name":1106,"imageUrl":1107,"description":1108,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":1109,"attributes":1110},"085",1038300,"珊瑚龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10383.png","喜歡將身體埋在沙子中擬態成珊瑚叢，利用頭背部珊瑚的夜光誘捕生物並伺機突襲。",[427],[499,396],{"id":1112,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":1113,"visible":15},"10003530",{"type":10,"entryId":1114,"sortOrder":1115,"name":1116,"imageUrl":1117,"description":1118,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":1119,"attributes":1120},"086",1046100,"海墩墩","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10461.png","腮幫子上的圓圈常被誤認為眼睛。喜歡成群結隊出現在海岸邊，與同伴擠在一起便會感到安心。",[311],[417],{"id":1122,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":1123,"visible":15},"10003457",{"type":10,"entryId":1124,"sortOrder":1125,"name":1126,"imageUrl":1127,"description":1128,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":1129,"attributes":1130},"087",1046300,"浪海象","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10463.png","用四肢在陸地移動時略顯笨拙，但極其擅長以肚皮滑行。同性間領地意識極強，一旦動怒便會展現海嘯般的威壓。",[311],[417],{"id":1132,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":1133,"visible":15},"10003423",{"type":10,"entryId":1134,"sortOrder":1135,"name":1136,"imageUrl":1137,"description":1138,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":1139,"attributes":1140},"088",1058100,"覓葉羊","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10581.png","懶洋洋地伸展葉羽，嘴裡總嚼個沒完，把綠藻和黏液變成飄飛的泡泡，輕輕一蹬，就能乘著泡泡悠悠出發。",[394],[374,396],{"id":1142,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":1143,"visible":15},"10003419",{"type":10,"entryId":1144,"sortOrder":1145,"name":1146,"imageUrl":1147,"description":1148,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":1149,"attributes":1150},"089",1058300,"麗芙羊","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10583.png","披著翠綠葉羽的麗芙羊體態輕盈，在湖岸邊悠哉漫步，特別喜歡清澈的水面，老是沉迷於水中倒影那優雅從容的模樣。",[394],[374,396],{"id":1152,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":1153,"visible":15},"10003410",{"type":10,"entryId":1154,"sortOrder":1155,"name":1156,"imageUrl":1157,"description":1158,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":1159,"attributes":1160},"090",1062100,"吐泡章魚","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10621.png","喜歡蒐集各種顏色的泡泡，氣囊裡的泡泡隨著身體動作起伏晃動，靈感一來，就會用繽紛的泡泡畫出奇妙的塗鴉。",[279],[396],{"id":1162,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":1163,"visible":15},"10003509",{"type":10,"entryId":1164,"sortOrder":1165,"name":1166,"imageUrl":1167,"description":1168,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":1169,"attributes":1170},"091",1062300,"扭蛋章魚","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10623.png","靈活的觸手可以刺激腦袋噴出不同的扭蛋泡泡，誰也不知道泡泡裡藏的是驚喜還是驚嚇。",[279],[396],{"id":1172,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":1173,"visible":15},"10003413",{"type":10,"entryId":1174,"sortOrder":1175,"name":1176,"imageUrl":1177,"description":1178,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":1179,"attributes":1180},"092",1042100,"海神魔","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10421.png","以開朗笑容偽裝自己並悄悄接近目標，一旦進入戰鬥便會顯露真面目，露出蓄勢待發的尖牙。",[279],[417],{"id":1182,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":1183,"visible":15},"10003407",{"type":10,"entryId":1184,"sortOrder":1185,"name":1186,"imageUrl":1187,"description":1188,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":237,"position":1189,"attributes":1190},"093",1042300,"魔海蝶","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10423.png","柔軟身軀中藏著尖牙與利爪，最擅長以溫柔無害的模樣令其他生物掉以輕心，再隨手將其凍成冰雕。",[279],[417],{"id":1192,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":1193,"visible":15},"10003498",{"type":10,"entryId":1194,"sortOrder":1195,"name":1196,"imageUrl":1197,"description":1198,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":227,"position":1199,"attributes":1200},"9997",1037300,"朧月狐","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10373.png","毛髮上流動著柔和月光，外表看似有些難以親近。總是理性冷靜地看待問題，但在面對熟悉之人時，也會露出親暱的神情。",[279],[1201],"attributes-holy",{"id":1203,"viewCount":59,"searchKey":1204,"visible":15},"10003375",{"type":10,"entryId":1205,"sortOrder":1206,"name":1207,"imageUrl":1208,"description":1209,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":227,"position":1210,"attributes":1211},"9998",1036100,"日耀獅","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10361.png","熱情活潑且自信滿滿，勇於保護同伴。關鍵時刻能覺醒強大力量，爆發出驚人的戰力。",[279],[1201],[1213,1221,1226,1231,1236,1241,1246,1251,1255,1259,1264,1268,1272,1277,1282,1287,1291,1296,1299],{"id":1214,"parentId":1215,"tagType":1216,"tagKey":1217,"name":1218,"language":1219,"sort":1220},"026e4b93d02640d817320316c3e0ae25","1500","morphologyTypes","Mountain Woods Form","山林型態","zh-TW",6,{"id":1222,"parentId":1215,"tagType":1216,"tagKey":1223,"name":1224,"language":1219,"sort":1225},"169975e83c7c7cc9196859ca36b9ab26","Forest Form","森林型態",8,{"id":1227,"parentId":1215,"tagType":1216,"tagKey":1228,"name":1229,"language":1219,"sort":1230},"450da43bc6001e686491fef2c68f8615","Grassland Form","草原型態",16,{"id":1232,"parentId":1215,"tagType":1216,"tagKey":1233,"name":1234,"language":1219,"sort":1235},"48eb29eb0654bfdfc12604830648a909","Cloudmist Form","雲海型態",18,{"id":1237,"parentId":1215,"tagType":1216,"tagKey":1238,"name":1239,"language":1219,"sort":1240},"4961211f443a4bc9f68cef49da91d934","Bay Form","海灣型態",15,{"id":1242,"parentId":1215,"tagType":1216,"tagKey":1243,"name":1244,"language":1219,"sort":1245},"5264fcf4157b04e2ba108f70d7b10d07","Plateau Form","高原型態",17,{"id":1247,"parentId":1215,"tagType":1216,"tagKey":1248,"name":1249,"language":1219,"sort":1250},"568127bc77f184cd4308056381642df7","Snowfield Form","雪地型態",5,{"id":1252,"parentId":1215,"tagType":1216,"tagKey":1253,"name":1254,"language":1219,"sort":98},"5989c0c15477b85af6544dca43428cd7","Rainstorm Form","雨天型態",{"id":1256,"parentId":1215,"tagType":1216,"tagKey":1257,"name":1258,"language":1219,"sort":83},"5b0d9a845ca8bccea70f5ed4fade58e7","Prismana Form","虹彩型態",{"id":1260,"parentId":1215,"tagType":1216,"tagKey":1261,"name":1262,"language":1219,"sort":1263},"8239aa22e7eae42c436efbcda46bbb9e","Nighttime Form","夜間型態",12,{"id":1265,"parentId":1215,"tagType":1216,"tagKey":13,"name":1266,"language":1219,"sort":1267},"8d1170ae789fe68dacb5164201cbe4a0","沙灘型態",14,{"id":1269,"parentId":1215,"tagType":1216,"tagKey":9,"name":1270,"language":1219,"s